DTEND:20261106T023000Z
SUMMARY:Chicago
LOCATION:Ambassador Theatre, 219 West 49th Street, New York NY 10019
DESCRIPTION:<p>A true New York City institution, <em>Chicago</em> has
  everything that makes Broadway great: a universal tale of fame, fortune,
  and all that jazz; one show-stopping song after another; and the most
  astonishing dancing you&rsquo;ve ever seen. No wonder <em>Chicago</em> has
  been honored with six Tony Awards<sup>&reg;</sup>, 2 Olivier Awards, a
  Grammy<sup>&reg;</sup> and thousands of standing ovations.<br /><br
  />It&rsquo;s also no surprise that <em>Chicago</em> has wowed audiences
  all around the world, from Mexico City to Moscow, S&atilde;o Paulo to
  South Africa, since 1996.<br /><br />Whether you&rsquo;re looking for your
  first Broadway musical, whether you&rsquo;ve seen the Academy
  Award&reg;-winning film and want to experience the show live onstage, or
  whether you&rsquo;ve seen it before and want to recapture the magic,
  <em>Chicago</em> always delivers.</p>
END:VEVENT
